--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
unexpected expression
--
User-reported as "invalid application of 'sizeof' to an incomplete
type" on `using lreg_t = G<uint16_t> __attribute__((aligned(16)));` --
a consequence of the class template G being lost to its trailing
attributes (cpp11_class_template_trailing_attributes); the attribute
on the alias itself is ignored by g++ and clang++ alike.
